IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `wra-core`
IMPORT `wra3-pt4-s95`

-- Tests for wra3-pt4-s95.l4. Expected values are written from the text of section 95 (raw lines 1510-1519), not from the output.

§ `s 95 tests`

-- "adult disability payment" means ... Working Age People (Scotland) Regulations 2022 (line 1511)
#ASSERT `s 95 disability assistance given in accordance with` `s 95 adult disability payment` EQUALS "Disability Assistance for Working Age People (Scotland) Regulations 2022"
-- "child disability payment" ... Children and Young People (Scotland) Regulations 2021 (S.S.I. 2021/174) (line 1512)
#ASSERT `s 95 disability assistance given in accordance with` `s 95 child disability payment` EQUALS "Disability Assistance for Children and Young People (Scotland) Regulations 2021 (S.S.I. 2021/174)"
-- "pension age disability payment" ... Older People (Scotland) Regulations 2024 (line 1517)
#ASSERT `s 95 disability assistance given in accordance with` `s 95 pension age disability payment` EQUALS "Disability Assistance for Older People (Scotland) Regulations 2024"
-- "Scottish adult disability living allowance" ... Regulations 2025 (line 1519)
#ASSERT `s 95 disability assistance given in accordance with` `s 95 Scottish adult disability living allowance` EQUALS "Disability Assistance (Scottish Adult Disability Living Allowance) Regulations 2025"

-- the named payment is given under its own regulations: yes; under another payment's regulations: no (a "means" definition)
#ASSERT `s 95 the disability assistance is the payment named` `s 95 adult disability payment` "Disability Assistance for Working Age People (Scotland) Regulations 2022" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 95 the disability assistance is the payment named` `s 95 adult disability payment` "Disability Assistance for Older People (Scotland) Regulations 2024" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 95 the disability assistance is the payment named` `s 95 child disability payment` "Disability Assistance for Children and Young People (Scotland) Regulations 2021 (S.S.I. 2021/174)" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 95 the disability assistance is the payment named` `s 95 child disability payment` "Disability Assistance for Working Age People (Scotland) Regulations 2022" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 95 the disability assistance is the payment named` `s 95 pension age disability payment` "Disability Assistance for Older People (Scotland) Regulations 2024" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 95 the disability assistance is the payment named` `s 95 pension age disability payment` "something else" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 95 the disability assistance is the payment named` `s 95 Scottish adult disability living allowance` "Disability Assistance (Scottish Adult Disability Living Allowance) Regulations 2025" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 95 the disability assistance is the payment named` `s 95 Scottish adult disability living allowance` "Disability Assistance for Working Age People (Scotland) Regulations 2022" EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- "daily living component" and "mobility component" mean the components of personal independence payment (lines 1514, 1516)
#ASSERT `s 95 daily living component means the daily living component of personal independence payment` EQUALS `daily living component`
#ASSERT `s 95 mobility component means the mobility component of personal independence payment` EQUALS `mobility component`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 95 daily living component means the daily living component of personal independence payment` EQUALS `mobility component`)

-- "daily living activities" has the meaning given by section 78(4); "mobility activities" by section 79(4) (lines 1513, 1515)
#ASSERT `s 95 daily living activities has the meaning given by` EQUALS "section 78(4)"
#ASSERT `s 95 mobility activities has the meaning given by` EQUALS "section 79(4)"

-- "prescribed" means prescribed by regulations (line 1518): the answer is the regulations' answer, and NOTHING when it is not supplied
#ASSERT `s 95 the matter is prescribed` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 95 the matter is prescribed` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 95 the matter is prescribed` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
